# request-coverage reads six files outside its own directory: the validator under test, the sibling
# grammar it shells to (validate-locked-anchor.sh), harness-origin.json, which the validator and
# the BL-327 arm read, route-fresh-start.md, the route table the --gate-step arms derive the
# opening steps from, gate_run.py, whose find_skill_dir locates that table, and planning.arms,
# which puts the gates/ directory find_skill_dir requires into the sandbox. The map rows under .git/.claude/core/skills are walk-up probes, not reads.
!core/scripts/validate-request-coverage.sh
core/scripts/validate-locked-anchor.sh
core/schemas/harness-origin.json
core/skills/ai-dlc/steps/route-fresh-start.md
core/scripts/gate_run.py
core/skills/ai-dlc/gates/planning.arms
core/fixtures/lib/report.sh
core/fixtures/lib/layout.sh
core/fixtures/lib/inproc.sh
core/fixtures/lib/mutant.sh
